message: "If you use this software or refer to this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Multi-Base Swarm Network Self-Healing"
abstract: >-
  A decentralized self-healing protocol for drone swarms that autonomously
  restores base-station connectivity using UWB ranging and multi-hop relay
  chains, evaluated in simulation against multi-base topologies.
type: software
authors:
